# Architecture

Before creating or changing files, read `docs/architecture.md` and follow its folder structure, naming conventions and database model exactly.

- Do not create tables, columns, folders or naming patterns that are not described there. If the task needs something that is missing or different, stop and ask the author.
- Never edit `docs/architecture.md`. Report proposed changes in the "Atenção" section of the delivery.
- Screens are Inertia pages. There is no separate JSON API.
- Run every command through `docker compose`.